  "description": "Tailwind CSS v4 in dotnet build, without Node: downloads the pinned standalone CLI for the build machine once per user, checks its SHA-256, and compiles the stylesheet before each build when a style or component changed. No support: built for my own projects and shared as is; issues and pull requests aren't monitored, and any release may change or break things.",
